{"steam_appid":2327720,"steam_name":"City Car Driving 2.0","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2327720/1040272299/f64db316ee0fe48978fbf10dac13455cc366f09f/1773650989/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774262565","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257304287/07e21abbeee26c26c0a7c693cfa63a05e17ae757/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1774262565","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/2c477626c68ee82fe28dd2c4759db7d755b61171/ss_2c477626c68ee82fe28dd2c4759db7d755b61171.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784529751","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/769b06d1d7fd33f4a3a701157f8416fda585aa58/ss_769b06d1d7fd33f4a3a701157f8416fda585aa58.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784529751","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/edd0d1d00b3580a565011205e537614dd9b0ef2d/ss_edd0d1d00b3580a565011205e537614dd9b0ef2d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784529751","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/a9ab28c8fd0546313d258952cdea3646618c9326/ss_a9ab28c8fd0546313d258952cdea3646618c9326.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784529751","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/bf59aa070f6a1a50f27ef116e5e66b0ecec78885/ss_bf59aa070f6a1a50f27ef116e5e66b0ecec78885.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784529751"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/b5ca0a0c2af71a9162afb8b2554ac77c.avif?t=1784529751\" width=256 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your car – explore an entire region where every sign, traffic light, and road marking follows real traffic laws. Become the ultimate driver in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/6ff98ec29c1f4485e8297accbde0bdaf.avif?t=1784529751\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras_big/6ff98ec29c1f4485e8297accbde0bdaf.avif?t=1784529751 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/b210ee0ac9d4f786eba94673fc01ebad.avif?t=1784529751\" width=298 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Become more confident on realistic roads:</strong> every traffic light, sign, and road marking is placed strictly according to traffic regulations, creating a believable environment for learning and honing your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Progress from novice to professional:</strong> from your first city turn to off-road driving — your actions impact the gameplay and carry realistic consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Prepare for the unexpected:</strong> unpredictable pedestrian behavior, dangerous lane changes, sudden hazards, and other dangers can occur at any moment – learn to make quick, correct decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Challenge yourself in various weather conditions:</strong> from morning fog to nighttime storms — the dynamic weather system will push your limits and create unique scenarios for every drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/bf26977e718b98e4ff62312502615bac.avif?t=1784529751\" width=371 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/4a36272bb730e7526ce3408e8761073c.webp?t=1784529751\" width=808 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/16bc20e5229589d38f7d24896c43c210.avif?t=1784529751\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras_big/16bc20e5229589d38f7d24896c43c210.webp?t=1784529751 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/23480db59b3a39c7d39e8699a4ea095d.webp?t=1784529751\" width=808 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/ff0acd3ad31784f8179025dff5ae8360.avif?t=1784529751\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/71b70e2769ff7a7d54f8aee68f88d0cd.webp?t=1784529751\" width=808 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/c9362438b37d736a2391e79f6592e405.avif?t=1784529751\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras_big/c9362438b37d736a2391e79f6592e405.webp?t=1784529751 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/863c7750ad6db0c27332bf7ffbba3dc4.avif?t=1784529751\" width=411 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>AI vehicles obey traffic laws:</strong> strictly following regulations, traffic yields to pedestrians at crosswalks, respects speed limits, reacts to changing road conditions, and interacts with other vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Every vehicle has unique behavior:</strong> each car in traffic acts differently, imitating various driving styles — from cautious beginners to aggressive drivers who stop at nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Traffic can make its own decisions:</strong> it can make mistakes, break rules, and handle situations on the fly — creating not only the atmosphere of a real road environment, but also unique gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/0b4b3897a9aff77df457128f4e4e61c4.avif?t=1784529751\" width=342 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/a8854b2d11c3e56c9757a7f0681c71ad.webp?t=1784529751\" width=809 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/6b3b6df24456b9ed42ad7e3c7d8fcbf2.avif?t=1784529751\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras_big/6b3b6df24456b9ed42ad7e3c7d8fcbf2.webp?t=1784529751 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/6e12181eb4ea63ae436ec94e63603050.webp?t=1784529751\" width=808 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/06e4fa74c982691a058aa8d77b469c56.avif?t=1784529751\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras_big/06e4fa74c982691a058aa8d77b469c56.webp?t=1784529751 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/aa8e34e9d20b317f39c8ba29904b2073.avif?t=1784529751\" width=394 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/f4a5019179c491714d931d0156bfae9d.avif?t=1784529751\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras_big/f4a5019179c491714d931d0156bfae9d.webp?t=1784529751 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327720/extras/1c7d0aaf722cb7e4152d21d4879b435a.webp?t=1784529751\" width=500 height=29 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 - 8400 2,8 GHz / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 3,4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce GTX1660 6 GB VRAM / AMD RX 5700 8 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any sound card compatible with DirectX</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400 2,5 GHz / AMD Ryzen 5 - 5600X 3,7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce RTX 3070 8 GB VRAM / AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT 16 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any sound card compatible with DirectX</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Racing","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Forward Development, Ltd."],"publishers":[" Forward Global Group, Ltd."],"release_date":"16 Jun, 2026"}